    <content:encoded>&lt;!-- wp:image {"id":4895,"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"media"} --&gt;
&lt;figure class="wp-block-image size-large"&gt;&lt;a href="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/bubbe-home.png"&gt;&lt;img src="https://flyingsummers.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/bubbe-home.png?w=1024" alt="" class="wp-image-4895" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;figcaption class="wp-element-caption"&gt;Bubbe, CYOW&lt;/figcaption&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:image --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you &lt;a href="https://flyingsummers.com/2022/06/08/flight-log-for-a-westward-crossing/"&gt;read this entry&lt;/a&gt; you saw Dexter's plague doctor in various spots as he crossed the country. After a summer of research on San Juan Island, Dexter returned to the east coast (Kenmore Air &amp;amp; JetBlue), spent a week in New Hampshire with friends, and then needed to return to Ottawa. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:more --&gt;
&lt;!--more--&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:more --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent weather (and a slight tailwind) for the flight. And now we will settle in for regular visits and transfers. Not needing the PCR test to cross the border is a nice change, making it possible to make a trip in the morning with a little planning the night before. I'd still like to be able to land at the little airport instead of the huge one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

